@startuml
title WAL Append Sequence

skinparam {
    shadowing false
    ArrowColor #444
    ParticipantFontSize 12
}

participant "Buffer Pool" as BP
participant "WAL Logger" as WAL
database "WAL File" as Log
participant "FileManager" as FM
database "Data File" as Disk

== Dirty Page Flush ==

BP -> WAL: Append(table, PageID, bytes)
WAL -> Log: write record (tableLen, table, pageID, dataLen, data)
WAL --> BP: ok
BP -> FM: WritePage(Page)
FM -> Disk: write block

== Explicit Flush ==

BP -> WAL: Sync()
WAL --> BP: log durable
BP -> FM: Sync()
FM --> BP: data durable

@enduml
